SUMMARY:2- Hour Kayak Float Trip
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nJoin us for a 2-Hour Kayak Trip 
 down a stretch of the French Broad River in Rosman\, NC - this is about 55
  minutes from AVL\, but well worth the drive for a relaxing day on the wat
 er.\n\nWe may be able to arrange some car-pooling. Message me to coordinat
 e.\n\nThis is more of a float than a paddle trip\, and you may get wet. Br
 ing water\, sunscreen\, and please wear appropriate clothing and footwear.
  You may also want to bring a towel and a change of clothes. We will proba
 bly go for lunch afterwards\, but you are welcome to bring your own lunch 
 or snacks.\n\nYou will need to book your own kayak rental\nOur start time 
 is 11 am\, so choose that as the start time when you book your kayak. Plea
 se note that the group must all rent kayaks and not tubes.\n[Tubular Tubin
 g Website for Rentals](https://www.tubulartubing.com/)
