SUMMARY:Potluck Hike to Lunch Rock
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nWe'll meet at the Folk Art Cente
 r for a hike to Lunch Rock where we will\, wait for it... have lunch! Brin
 g your potluck items and we'll eat while enjoying an amazing view.\n\nThe 
 hike is about 1-1.5 hours each way and I'd consider it a good workout as t
 he trail goes up and down the whole time. Lunch Rock is a lookout point on
  top of a large boulder with a nice view. **Please be careful when we get 
 there as there is a steep drop-off at the end of it.**\n\nPlease try to be
  on time. As with other Meetup hikes\, if you're late you might miss us.\n
 \nHope to see you there!\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Release of Liability:**\n\nThe organ
 izer of this event is a volunteer and not a professional. The function of 
 the organizer is only to organize this event. If you sign up or participat
 e in this event you acknowledge that you freely and voluntarily agree to a
 ssume all risks of injuries\, illnesses and damages arising from\, as a re
 sult of and associated with this event. In addition\, you acknowledge that
  you agree to the Meetup terms: [https://www.meetup.com/terms](https://www
 .meetup.com/terms)
