SUMMARY:Steven Spielberg's Disclosure Day (Dinner/Drinks + Movie) - Now Ju
 ne 27th
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nLet's watch Steven Spielberg's n
 ew movie about aliens/UFOs after getting some dinner and/or drinks at Thir
 sty Monk South (in walking distance from the theater).\n\nFeel free to deb
 ate whether you think 👽👽👽 exist in the comments... 🙂\n\nHope t
 o see you there!
